flowchart TD
  subgraph internet["Internet (Untrusted)"]
    Clin([Clinician Browser])
    IdP([Health-System IdP OIDC / SAML])
  end
  subgraph vpc["MedScribe VPC"]
    GW[API Gateway Cloud Armor]
    CP[clinician-portal Next.js 15]
    ABAC[ABAC service care-team check]
    Mongo[(MongoDB notes / transcripts de-identified views)]
  end
  Clin -->|HTTPS session cookie| GW
  GW -->|JWT validated| CP
  Clin -->|OIDC login| IdP
  IdP -->|id_token role/tenant_id| CP
  CP -->|note read/approve| ABAC
  ABAC -->|allow/deny care-team| CP
  CP -->|approved note set approved_by| Mongo
